          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Exploring Some Geometric Themes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.087,
            0.674,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ What happens to the length of a line in its projection?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.113,
            0.588,
            0.169
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us consider projections in Fig. 4.3. For example let l be the actual length of the line and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " be the length of its projection."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.168,
            0.587,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Draw AE ⊥ BC. AECD is a rectangle (why?). So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "AE = DC = p."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Also, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle  AEB = 90^{\\circ}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.206,
            0.569,
            0.232
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you now compare the lengths p and l?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.244,
            0.588,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ When is the length of the projected line equal to its actual length?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.629,
            0.09,
            0.841,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
